Attrition %        = (Left / Average Headcount) * 100
Shrinkage %        = (Non-Productive Time / Total Time) * 100
Occupancy %        = (Handling Time / Effective Working Time) * 100
Utilization %      = (Productive Time / Total Time) * 100
AHT                = (TT + HT + ACW) / Calls
SLA %              = (Calls ≤ Threshold / Total Calls) * 100
FTE                = (Calls * AHT / 3600) / 8
Schedule Adherence = (Actual / Scheduled) * 100
Absenteeism %      = (Absent / Scheduled) * 100
Productivity       = (Output / Input) * 100
